OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Erik
OL,5,     FChisholm
OL,6,     GKate Molleson, with Dr John
OL,7,     GPurser, traces Chisholm's early
OL,8,     Glife, folk inspirations and first
OL,9,     Gsteps in music.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,12,     Gfrom pianist Alexandra Dariescu,
OL,13,     Gplus writer Susan Wokoma talks
OL,14,     Gabout the new musical 'Handel and
OL,15,     GHendrix'.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
