OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 FEB
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GLudovic Morlot conducts the
OL,6,     GBournemouth Symphony Orchestra in
OL,7,     GSpanish music including Ravel's
OL,8,     Giconic Bolero and de Falla's
OL,9,     GNights in the Gardens of Spain
OL,10,     Gwith Steven Osborne.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Almost Famous
OL,12,     GIan Sansom reflects on obscurity
OL,13,     Gas an index of cultural values
OL,14,     Gthrough five figures whose
OL,15,     Greputations offer a map of
OL,16,     Gshifting tastes, beginning with
OL,17,     Gcomposer Granville Bantock.
